Hi team,

I built a small app to make tracking our 50% office target easier, and you're=
 welcome to use it.

What it does
- Shows where you stand each month on both rules, office days and office hour=
s, as + or - against the target.
- One tap to clock in when you arrive and out when you leave. Leave and publi=
c holidays never count against you.
- Lets you plan weeks ahead and see where the month will land.

What it isn't
- It's a personal tracker, not an official system, so keep using the usual ch=
annels for anything formal like leave.
- There's no account or sign-up, and your data stays on your phone. If you tu=
rn on the optional cloud backup, it's encrypted on your phone before it's sen=
t and only you can unlock it. I can't see anyone's data.

Getting started (about 5 minutes)
1. Open https://officeattendance.kaiobe.workers.dev on your phone (Safari on =
iPhone, Chrome on Android).
2. Answer the setup questions. The defaults are an 8.75-hour day, 9:00 to 17:=
45, and the 50% target.
3. Save your recovery code somewhere safe.
4. Add it to your home screen so it works like an app.

Attached
- Office-Attendance-Guide.pdf: the full step-by-step guide.
- Office-Attendance-Getting-Started.mp4: a 3-minute walkthrough. It has capti=
ons and no sound, so it's fine to watch at your desk.

If something doesn't look right, or there's a feature you'd find useful, let =
me know.

Cheers,
Kai

